NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL5"] = "To fight your enemies, click on the spells on your |cffffd200Action Bar|r."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL50"] = "You now have a keyring to hold your keys.This |cffffd200Keyring Button|r appears to the left of your bags on your action bar."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL51"] = "You can enter dungeons or find groups for dungeons by using the |cffffd200Dungeon Finder|r. The Dungeon Finder is accessed from the eye button near the middle of your action bar."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL52"] = "Congratulations, you have received your first Battle Pet. This little fellow will follow you during all of your adventures in Azeroth and beyond.|n|nYou can see all of your Battle Pets by clicking the |cffffd200Collections|r button and then looking for the  |cffffd200Pet Journal|r tab."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL53"] = "Congratulations, you have learned how to summon your first mount. This mighty steed will carry you throughout your adventures in Azeroth and beyond.|n|nTo see all of your mounts, click the |cffffd200Collections|r button and look for the |cffffd200Mounts|r tab. You can drag your favorite mount onto your action bar to summon it more easily."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL54"] = "You have attracted the attention of a hostile creature.|n|nA red glow means the creature is attacking you. A yellow glow means you are in danger of being attacked. An orange glow means the creature is attacking you, but may soon change targets."
