NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL56"] = "In the upper left corner of your screen is your health bar in green. When your health bar reaches zero, you will die, so be careful.|n|nBelow your health bar is a second bar representing the resource your class uses to power your special abilities, such as rage, energy or mana."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL57_HUMAN"] = "Remember to visit |cffffd200Marshal McBride|r. He has a quest for you! |cffffd200Right Click|r on him when your cursor is a |cffffd200Yellow Question Mark|r."
