NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL60"] = "Remember, your character has special abilities on the action bar on the lower part of your screen.|n|nUsing those abilities will kill an enemy much faster than just swinging your weapon."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL61_DRUID"] = "As a druid, you can |cffffd200shapeshift|r into different forms, each with unique abilities and their own resource. Your first form, Cat, increases your melee damage."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL61_HUNTER"] = "You now have a |cffffd200Pet Action Bar|r, for more control over your pet. In addition, you have the ability to |cffffd200tame beasts|r to gain new pets"
