NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL7"] = "If you defeat an enemy and see sparkles on its corpse, that means it has loot.|n|n|cffffd200Right Click|r on a creature's corpse to loot it. This will open a loot window. Then |cffffd200Right Click|r on any items in that window to move them to your backpack."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL8"] = "An item went into your backpack.|n|nYou can click on the |cffffd200Backpack Button|r in the lower right part of the screen to open your backpack.  Move the mouse over the item to see what it is."
NS.GlobalStrings["TUTORIAL9"] = "Some items can be used. |cffffd200Right Click|r on an item to use it.|n|nYou can drag an item onto your action bar if you want to use it without opening your backpack."
